DESCRIPTION:The December First Thursdays will highlight special partnersh
 ips and art spaces on campus. A collaboration with the Indiana Memorial Un
 ion on Light Up the Night will bring an expanded wintertime market to the 
 annual event along with arts activities\, performances\, ice skating\, and
  the candle-lighting ceremony. The schedule also includes arts programming
  at the Eskenazi Museum of Art and extended hours at the Grunwald Gallery 
 .For the full list of locations\, activities\, and details\, please visit 
 go.iu.edu/first-thursdays .
