 tionship between the American press and the civil rights movement led by D
 r. King and his contemporaries.  Presented by The Dr. Martin Luther King 
 Jr. Birthday Celebration Commission. BCT Event Link: https://buskirkchumle
 y.org/ events/2027-dr-martin-luther- king-jr-birthday-celebration- event-j
 anuary-18-2027/ MLK Commission Web Link: https://bloomington.in.gov/ board
 s/mlk —
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 East Kirkwood Avenue\,  Bloomington
 \, IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/dr-martin-luther-king-jr-birthday-celebration-
 event-mlk-the-black-press-200-years-of-pleading-our-own-cause/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
