BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Snowy Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270205T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270205T213000
UID:1131abbdf95be0e2109faa60642b250a@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Music by Joel Thompson\; Libretto by Andrea Davis Pinkney A yo
 ung boy wakes to find his world magically transformed overnight—blankete
 d in fresh\, glittering snow. Ezra Jack Keats’ 1962 book is a joyful\, w
 onder-filled adventure through the city streets that became an equally del
 ightful opera: the tale of Peter’s first snow day on his own. NB: Pre-sh
 ow Opera Insights talk at 6:30 in the North Lobby
LOCATION:IU Musical Arts Center\, 101 North Eagleson Avenue\,  Bloomington
 \, IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/the-snowy-day/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
